# RadAssistant extension description file
# Reference: https://slicer.readthedocs.io/en/latest/developer_guide/extensions.html
# Replace the REPLACE-ME URLs with your real repository before submitting to the
# Slicer Extensions Index. Not required for a local build / "Install from file".

# Source-control type and location
scm git
scmurl https://github.com/REPLACE-ME/RadAssistant.git
scmrevision main

# Extensions this one depends on ("NA" if none)
depends NA

# Directory (relative to the checkout) that contains the top-level CMakeLists.txt
build_subdirectory .

# Metadata shown in the Extensions Manager
homepage https://github.com/REPLACE-ME/RadAssistant
contributors RadAssistant contributors
category Utilities
iconurl https://raw.githubusercontent.com/REPLACE-ME/RadAssistant/main/RadAssistant.png
description Natural-language agentic assistant for 3D Slicer. Bring your own model (local via Ollama / OpenAI-compatible, or Anthropic cloud). It drives Slicer's validated tools and shows its work. Research/visualization aid, not a diagnostic device.
screenshoturls

enabled 1
